{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>PineScreen 是一款把螢幕使用時間與真實行動連結的工具，透過完成掌上壓、學習或每日挑戰來解鎖更多使用時間，適合想減少社交媒體滑動、建立運動與學習習慣及改善專注力的人。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-119.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>完成挑戰賺取螢幕時間</h2>\n<p>PineScreen 可讓用家限制分心應用程式，設定每日免費螢幕時間與上限，並透過完成挑戰賺取額外分鐘。挑戰包括以相機及 AI 輔助計算掌上壓或高抬腿次數，也可選擇英文詞彙、填空題與小測驗等學習任務；每日挑戰和松樹成長會反映習慣進度。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1260x2736bb-19-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1260x2736bb-20-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1260x2736bb-21-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1260x2736bb-22-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1260x2736bb-23-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：PineScreen: Push Up Blocker</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/pinescreen-push-up-blocker/id6446350660?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.609855+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":304,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T12:21:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:43.483799+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:43.483799+00:00","content_hash":"272fd24fb13045d0c65b5921be2d58602361791eca84a2beef10739ce11e4701","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}